turns 3 of them red. Gates: typecheck clean (3 workspaces), client 206, server 105, game-core full suite green."}
{"ts": "2026-11-11T10:50:00", "task": "CH-000 Rachael Foley: custom character (turn-start Explore debt + solo low-HP damage)", "status": "ok", "attempts": 0, "note": "Manny sent the card scan and asked to implement this custom character. Card: [CHARACTER] RACHAEL FOLEY, printed code CH-000, 80 Health, gates 1 / 5. Text verbatim - L1: At the beginning of your turn, you can get +1 Explore. If so, Rachael must Explore at least twice this turn. L2: Whenever Rachael Explores, if she has no Partner and she has 50 or less Health, she gets +20 damage this turn. Wrote SPEC_RACHAEL.md first (prompt kind + resolution semantics), per the character-ability rule. Data: data/custom.ts id ch-000, maxHp 80, level1At 1, level2At 5, abilities turnStartPlusExploreRequiresTwoExplores (L1) and exploreDamageIfNoPartnerLowHp {amount:20,hpThreshold:50} (L2). L1 needed a COUNT-based obligation the engine did not have (mustExplore is a boolean meaning at-least-one): new PlayerState.exploresRequiredThisTurn?:number, set to 2 by the turn-start prompt (turnStartPlusExploreRequiresTwoExplores, options Gain +1 Explore / Decline) which also adds +1 Explore; applyOutbreakHooks pays it down by exploreCount (a multi-explore of 2 IS two Explores) via the new payExploreDebt helper, and the Sherry forced-explore path (sherryForceExplore) pays 1 for the target seat; startTurn clears it to undefined; validate blocks endTurn while it is > 0 AND canExploreLegally, so a seat that cannot explore is never deadlocked. New shared mustExploreNow(state,seat) predicate (Wesker mustExplore OR the debt) now drives the validator and the bot's never-volunteer-an-unarmed-explore filter in ai/policy.ts (both call sites). The old Wesker-only error message is preserved so existing abilities.test.ts assertions still pass; the debt case gets its own message. L2 is a per-explore bonus on the shared abilityDamage term in actions.ts (so single- and multi-explore both get it), mirroring exploreBonusIfAmmoAbove. Art: CARD-ART/CH-000.png 320x446 107KB P-mode from the scan (cardArt.ts globs the directory). Tests: new engine/customRachael.test.ts (15) - data shape, absent from ALL_CARDS, turn-start offer and its absence below L1, accept/decline, debt blocks endTurn then pays down one explore at a time, multi-explore pays 2 at once, deadlock guard, next-turn reset, and four L2 cases (solo at 50 gets it; 51 HP, level 1 and has-partner do not). Regression-checked: disabling the prompt resolver and the L2 term turns 6 of them red. Gates: typecheck clean (3 workspaces), client 206, server 105; game-core full suite re-run in progress against a baseline of 6 pre-existing failures from the earlier pull (4 stale ai/evaluate expectations, 1 ai/sim explore-rate heuristic, 1 real Red Executioner double-shuffle conservation bug)."}
{"ts": "2026-11-11T12:05:00", "task": "Fix the 3 pre-existing failures the pull left behind (soak conservation, evaluate x4, sim rate)", "status": "ok", "attempts": 0, "note": "All three reproduced on the clean pulled tree (43eb09c) with my work stashed, and all three are now green. 1) ai/soak.test.ts alliance/2 conservation failure had TWO causes, both in the multi-explore path around MA-078 Red Executioner: (a) applyMercenariesNotDefeatedEffects already shuffles MA-078 back into the Mansion AND sets infectedShuffledBack, but the multi-explore caller shuffled it back a SECOND time, so the same instance ended up 3x in mansionDeck - removed the redundant block (the single-explore caller always treated the flag as already-handled); (b) newPlayer.attached was built from state.seats[seat].attached (the PRE-explore seat), so MA-078's removal of the highest-Decoration trophy was dropped and that trophy sat in BOTH the Mansion and the Combo Pile - newPlayer.attached is now built from the live post-effect seat (fxState) and the Decoration delta is carried into decorations via decorationDelta(A, A)=0 so it is a no-op when nothing moved. Verified with a direct probe: alliance seeds 2/3/4 now report zero duplicate placements. 2) ai/evaluate.test.ts had 4 stale exact-score assertions after 43eb09c deliberately changed CARD_DRAW_VALUE 12->20 and affordablePiles to 8 + floor(ownedVal*0.6) + marketPull; updated the expectations and their derivations (230->239 with piles now 15+14=29, 222->230, 176->180, 462->470), computing each from the new weights rather than blessing the output. 3) ai/sim.test.ts explore-rate heuristic: measured both sides of 43eb09c on the same 8 seeds - perTurn 0.106 -> 0.064 but total explores 395 -> 426 and Decorations 381 -> 408 with 7/8 games still ending naturally, so the bots fight MORE in absolute terms and just take longer; moved the floor 0.08 -> 0.06 and added an absolute totalExplores > 300 guard, keeping gameOverCount as the real anti-freeze guard